query subheading is:
    the subheading of which good is which code.

query heading is:
    the heading of which good is which heading.

query unplaced is:
    which good is not placed by the model.

% NY N337067 (December 2023): a men's woven jacket from Vietnam.
% CBP: style 5781522 -> 6201.20
scenario ny_n337067 is, as stated in ruling NY N337067:
    the kind of style 5781522 is jacket,
        confer "Style 5781522 is a men’s hip-length jacket".
    the cut of style 5781522 indicates men,
        confer "Style 5781522 is a men’s hip-length jacket".
    the fabric construction of style 5781522 is woven,
        confer "constructed from a 70% wool, 25% nylon, 5% polyester twill woven fabric".
    style 5781522 contains 70 percent of wool,
        confer "constructed from a 70% wool, 25% nylon, 5% polyester twill woven fabric".
    style 5781522 contains 25 percent of nylon,
        confer "constructed from a 70% wool, 25% nylon, 5% polyester twill woven fabric".
    style 5781522 contains 5 percent of polyester,
        confer "constructed from a 70% wool, 25% nylon, 5% polyester twill woven fabric".
    style 5781522 has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "The garment features a half front opening with a four-snap closure".
    style 5781522 has pockets below the waist,
        confer "a pass through kangaroo pocket below the waist".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style 5781522 is 6201.20"].

% NY N362589 (July 2026): a men's jacket of knit and woven components from Vietnam.
