    the essential character of style LD-4330 is given by no single component,
        according to CBP, confer "specifically 3(c), under the heading that occurs last in numerical order".
    % CBP: neither fabric exceeds 60% of the visible surface nor imparts the
    % essential character; classified by GRI 3(c), the heading last in order.
    the kind of style LD-4330 is jacket,
        confer "Style LD-4330 is a men’s jacket constructed from both knit and woven components".
    the cut of style LD-4330 indicates men,
        confer "Style LD-4330 is a men’s jacket constructed from both knit and woven components".
    style LD-4330 is a composite good,
        confer "constructed from both knit and woven components".
    the woven parts of style LD-4330 is a component of style LD-4330,
        confer "The hood, sleeves, back yoke, and the shoulders, are constructed from 100% polyamide woven fabric".
    the fabric construction of the woven parts of style LD-4330 is woven,
        confer "The hood, sleeves, back yoke, and the shoulders, are constructed from 100% polyamide woven fabric".
    the woven parts of style LD-4330 contains 100 percent of polyamide,
        confer "The hood, sleeves, back yoke, and the shoulders, are constructed from 100% polyamide woven fabric".
    the knit body of style LD-4330 is a component of style LD-4330,
        confer "The balance of the garment is constructed from 82% polyester, and 18% elastane knit fabric".
    the fabric construction of the knit body of style LD-4330 is knitted,
        confer "The balance of the garment is constructed from 82% polyester, and 18% elastane knit fabric".
    the knit body of style LD-4330 contains 82 percent of polyester,
        confer "The balance of the garment is constructed from 82% polyester, and 18% elastane knit fabric".
    the knit body of style LD-4330 contains 18 percent of elastane,
        confer "The balance of the garment is constructed from 82% polyester, and 18% elastane knit fabric".
    style LD-4330 has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "full frontal opening secured with zipper closures".
    style LD-4330 has pockets below the waist,
        confer "pockets below the waist secured by zipper closures".
    style LD-4330 has a means of tightening at the bottom,
        confer "the garment bottom is bound with an elasticized binding tape".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style LD-4330 is 6201.40"].

