% NY N341947 (September 2024): a costume dress and cape from China.
% CBP: Anna Classic Dress -> 6204.43; Anna Classic Cape -> 6211.43
scenario ny_n341947 is, as stated in ruling NY N341947:
    % DISAGREES (the cape): CBP gives 6211.43; the model gives 6202.40 —
    % heading 6202 names capes; CBP treats this costume cape as an other
    % garment, not outerwear.
    % Anna Classic Dress is the dress of the “Anna (Frozen I) Classic Dress”
    % (styles 252142 to 252182 by size), Anna Classic Cape its cape. No gender
    % fact: the ruling states none (CBP's code is for girls').
    the kind of Anna Classic Dress is dress,
        confer "consists of a dress and a cape constructed of knit and woven components".
    Anna Classic Dress is a composite good,
        confer "Because the garment is made up of different fabrics, it is considered a composite good".
    the woven parts of Anna Classic Dress is a component of Anna Classic Dress,
        confer "The front bodice of the dress, the sleeves, collar, skirt layers and cape are made of 100 percent polyester woven fabric".
    the fabric construction of the woven parts of Anna Classic Dress is woven,
        confer "The front bodice of the dress, the sleeves, collar, skirt layers and cape are made of 100 percent polyester woven fabric".
    the woven parts of Anna Classic Dress contains 100 percent of polyester,
        confer "The front bodice of the dress, the sleeves, collar, skirt layers and cape are made of 100 percent polyester woven fabric".
    the knit back bodice of Anna Classic Dress is a component of Anna Classic Dress,
        confer "The back bodice is made of 100 percent polyester knit fabric".
    the fabric construction of the knit back bodice of Anna Classic Dress is knitted,
        confer "The back bodice is made of 100 percent polyester knit fabric".
    the knit back bodice of Anna Classic Dress contains 100 percent of polyester,
        confer "The back bodice is made of 100 percent polyester knit fabric".
    the essential character of Anna Classic Dress is given by the woven parts of Anna Classic Dress,
        according to CBP, confer "the woven fabric which comprises most of the dress imparts the essential character".
    Anna Classic Dress is claimed to belong to festive articles,
        confer "you believe this costume is properly classified under heading 9505 as “festive articles.”".
    the claim that Anna Classic Dress belongs to festive articles is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "your costumes are well made".
    the kind of Anna Classic Cape is cape,
        confer "consists of a dress and a cape constructed of knit and woven components".
    the fabric construction of Anna Classic Cape is woven,
        confer "skirt layers and cape are made of 100 percent polyester woven fabric".
    Anna Classic Cape contains 100 percent of polyester,
        confer "skirt layers and cape are made of 100 percent polyester woven fabric".
    Anna Classic Cape is claimed to belong to festive articles,
        confer "you believe this costume is properly classified under heading 9505 as “festive articles.”".
    the claim that Anna Classic Cape belongs to festive articles is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "your costumes are well made".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of Anna Classic Dress is 6204.43", "the subheading of Anna Classic Cape is 6202.40"].

