% NY N360359 (April 2026): women's disposable underwear briefs from Thailand.
% CBP: the postpartum underwear -> 6210.10
scenario ny_n360359 is, as stated in ruling NY N360359:
    the essential character of the postpartum underwear is given by no single component,
        according to CBP, confer "The disposable underwear shall be classified in accordance with (GRI) 3(c)".
    % A composite good of nonwoven polypropylene and paper pulp; CBP finds that no
    % essential character can be determined and applies GRI 3(c). The importer's
    % proposal (6210.10.7000) is of the same heading: no claim recorded.
    % VOCAB: paper pulp, no listed material.
    the kind of the postpartum underwear is briefs,
        confer "is a women’s disposable, seamless boyshort-style brief for one-time use".
    the cut of the postpartum underwear indicates women,
        confer "is a women’s disposable, seamless boyshort-style brief for one-time use".
    the postpartum underwear is made up of fabric of heading 5603,
        confer "as a garment made of nonwoven fabric of heading 5603".
    the postpartum underwear is a composite good,
        confer "Since the underwear is a composite good constructed from two different materials".
    the nonwoven layers of the postpartum underwear is a component of the postpartum underwear,
        confer "You state the top and bottom layers consist of 100 percent polypropylene spun bond nonwoven".
    the fabric construction of the nonwoven layers of the postpartum underwear is nonwoven,
        confer "You state the top and bottom layers consist of 100 percent polypropylene spun bond nonwoven".
    the nonwoven layers of the postpartum underwear contains 100 percent of polypropylene,
        confer "You state the top and bottom layers consist of 100 percent polypropylene spun bond nonwoven".
    the paper pulp layer of the postpartum underwear is a component of the postpartum underwear,
        confer "while the middle layer is made of paper pulp".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the postpartum underwear is 6210.10"].

