% A view (docs/le_summary.md §17.10): the classification worksheet of
% CustomsOfficerReport.md — the good's facts as the ruling states them,
% grouped, each with its passage; the subheading with the steps that cite the
% tariff; the ruling beside it; every ruling of the file with its code.
the view worksheet is:
    the title is "Classification worksheet".
    the case is a scenario, with the documents it is stated in.
    the facts about "the article" are
        the kind of a good is a kind,
        the cut of a garment indicates a gender.
    the facts about "the fabric" are
        the fabric construction of a garment is a construction.
    the facts about "the composition" are
        a good contains a number percent of a material.
    the facts about "the measurements" are
        a good is approximately square,
        the longest side of a good measures a number centimetres.
    the result is the answer to query subheading, headed by the code.
    the result shows its citations.
    the result asks what is missing.
    the result can be flipped.
    the documents of the case are shown beside the facts.
    the cases are listed with their results.
    the draft reads "CLASSIFICATION: The applicable subheading for the goods of {the case} will be {the result}, Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS). The facts relied on: {the facts}.".
